We can simplify this expression using the factorization $x^3 + y^3 + z^3 - 3xyz = (x + y + z)(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 - xy - xz - yz)$. We start by writing $30^3 + 40^3 + 50^3 - 3 \cdot 30 \cdot 40 \cdot 50$ and we get
\begin{align*}
\sqrt[3]{30^3 + 40^3 + 50^3} &= \sqrt[3]{30^3 + 40^3 + 50^3 + 3 \cdot 30 \cdot 40 \cdot 50 - 3 \cdot 30 \cdot 40 \cdot 50} \\
&= \sqrt[3]{(30 + 40 + 50)(30^2 + 40^2 + 50^2 - 30 \cdot 40 - 30 \cdot 50 - 40 \cdot 50) + 180000} \\
&= \sqrt[3]{120(2500 - 1800) + 180000} \\
&= \sqrt[3]{360000} \\
&= \boxed{60}
\end{align*}

